<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20389" root="سلحب" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْلِحَبٌّ</span></b>  <i>Right, direct, rightly directed,
straight,</i> or <i>even:</i> (S, K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتْلَئِبٌّ</span>. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Extended:</i> (S:) or <i>conspicuous and extended:</i>
(K:) applied to a road: (S, K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطْلَحِبٌّ</span>.
(L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>I. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْبَطِحٌ</span> [app. as meaning <i>Spread
out,</i> or <i>expanded</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلَّ يَوْمَنَا مُسَْحِبًّا</span>
means <i>Our day was,</i> or <i>became, one of protracted
journeying.</i> (L, TA.)

